{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "1. Click **Open Privacy & Security**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Haz clic en **Abrir Privacidad y seguridad**."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "2. Turn on **KeelMac** under Full Disk Access. If it isn’t listed, click the plus button and choose KeelMac in Applications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Activa **KeelMac** en Acceso total al disco. Si no aparece, haz clic en el botón de más y elige KeelMac en Aplicaciones."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "3. Come back here. KeelMac notices the change on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Vuelve aquí. KeelMac detecta el cambio por sí solo."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A full scan takes about a minute and never reads file contents. After that, rescans only look at folders that changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un escaneo completo tarda alrededor de un minuto y nunca lee el contenido de los archivos. Después, los nuevos escaneos solo revisan las carpetas que cambiaron."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Agents and daemons that start with your Mac appear here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí aparecen los agentes y servicios que arrancan con tu Mac."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Alerts": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alertas"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Apps in /Applications and ~/Applications appear here with their size and last use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí aparecen las apps de /Applications y ~/Applications con su tamaño y último uso."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Choose folders to search": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige carpetas para buscar"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Clean": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limpiar"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Cleanup": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limpieza"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Cleanup and safety": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limpieza y seguridad"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Continue without access": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuar sin acceso"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copiado"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Copy": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copiar"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Dashboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Panel"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Duplicates": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Duplicados"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Each task shows the exact command it runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada tarea muestra el comando exacto que ejecuta."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Everything KeelMac moves or deletes is listed here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí aparece todo lo que KeelMac mueve o borra."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Files in your Library from apps that are no longer installed appear here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí aparecen los archivos de tu Biblioteca de apps que ya no están instaladas."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Full Disk Access is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acceso total al disco desactivado"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Full Disk Access is off. Checking again every few seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El acceso total al disco está desactivado. Revisando de nuevo cada pocos segundos."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Full Disk Access is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El acceso total al disco está activado."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "General"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Go": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ir"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Go to dashboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ir al panel"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Helper": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asistente"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "History": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Historial"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "KeelMac": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KeelMac"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "KeelMac checks again each time you open Cleanup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KeelMac vuelve a revisar cada vez que abres Limpieza."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "KeelMac compares files byte for byte. Nothing is moved until you choose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KeelMac compara archivos byte por byte. Nada se mueve hasta que tú eliges."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "KeelMac measures the folders macOS counts as System Data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KeelMac mide las carpetas que macOS cuenta como Datos del sistema."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "KeelMac needs Full Disk Access to see caches, logs and other folders macOS protects. It never reads file contents, except to compare files when you look for duplicates.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KeelMac necesita acceso total al disco para ver cachés, registros y otras carpetas que macOS protege. Nunca lee el contenido de los archivos, salvo para compararlos cuando buscas duplicados."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "KeelMac takes one every week, so you can see what grew.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KeelMac toma una cada semana para que veas qué creció."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Large and old files": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archivos grandes y antiguos"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Large and old files come from the storage scan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los archivos grandes y antiguos salen del escaneo de almacenamiento."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Leftovers": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restos"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Live charts fill in from the left every two seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las gráficas en vivo se llenan desde la izquierda cada dos segundos."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
